CRITIC / QUALITY
Generator != evaluator != promoter. Independent critics remain required at Verification + Critic Control triggers and major distributed integration gates. A worker return never self-promotes Current, Human Accepted or Served. Distributed guide roles remove a chat bottleneck; they do not collapse authority boundaries.

SUCCESS
Opening many identical `/wc` chats should quickly produce visible beacons, exclusive owners, distinct/complementary execution, fast safe replacement of silent owners, guide/planner/integrator/rescate work when the frontier needs cognition, loser re-entry, sequential task rotation, durable successors and rising useful results per human intervention. Routine planning/integration must not wait for one specific `/g` chat.

TRUTH BOUNDARY
Chat launches are still externally initiated unless a separate runtime proves automatic invocation. Distributed guide roles remove dependence on one specific guide conversation for routine cognition/routing; they do not by themselves prove unattended autonomous invocation.

If a capability lacks actual receipts/canary evidence, report it as UNPROVEN/PARTIAL rather than pretending it is operational.
